cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Power Platform Monitoring Framework (PPMF)"
abstract: >-
  A low-code monitoring framework for Microsoft Power Platform that detects broken
  connections across environments, resolves the cloud flows and canvas apps they
  affect, notifies each connection owner with remediation steps, and records all
  activity in a structured Dataverse log.
